{"id":1060901,"chapter_id":1060901,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"……于是这伙流窜到砂海的罪犯就被抓获了。不过对方城镇的首领不知道从哪里得知了有关您的信息，指名要求“MBCC的局长”来主持引渡工作。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"办公室中，来自涅槃的办事员正给你解释这次工作的具体内容。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"因此，议会方面希望您能拨冗前往……没有过多工作，安保方面全程由FAC负责，您仅需出面即可。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"你看了一眼自己的工作安排，近期似乎确实有些空闲。如果能把这次出差当作一次短途旅行，去散散心也不错。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"options":["答应前往"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901005,"trial_step":5,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"答应前往","goto":6}]},{"step":6,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"那再好不过了，我代表涅槃感谢您的理解……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"你挥了挥手。虽然碍于上庭的面子你和涅槃不得不揣着明白装糊涂共事，但你打心眼里还是不太喜欢这些家伙。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"还有别的事么？没有的话……","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"您稍等，的确还有些事情希望您能留心。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"你就知道涅槃的人还有别的目的，没那么容易被打发走。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"是这样的，就在不久前我们的人得知，还有一名新城逃犯流窜到了那座城镇。据可靠消息称，那人是一名拥有危险能力的禁闭者。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"有身份信息么？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"有的。她叫“芭·菲”，自称新城的“投资之神”，或许您听说过她。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"嗯，我知道这个人。不过我一直很好奇，她到底犯了什么事被你们盯上了？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"半年前，芭·菲用一系列的手段，伪造了关于异方晶的大量虚假消息。数以百计的投资人因此损失惨重，异方晶市场的稳定性遭到了难以估量的破坏。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"可以毫不夸张地说，她是狄斯城有史以来，影响最恶劣的经济犯……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"行了，我知道了。到了那边我会留意这个芭·菲的……不过我建议你们也别抱太大希望，等我到了那边她早就跑了也说不定。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"理解理解，我们早就做好了持久战的准备，您能答应留意就已经帮大忙了。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"涅槃员工","content":"这是有关芭·菲的全套材料，我们不求您真的能把她抓捕归案，能在工作之余打听下一手消息也是好的……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"到头来，什么消息也没打听到……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"content":"砂船轰鸣即将启航，你合上芭·菲的档案。这些天你倒是有意无意地打听了她的消息，然而没有得到任何有用的收获。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"算了……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"content":"你把档案放回包中。这次外出公干时间不长，但和涅槃的人说得不一样，不仅行程密集工作还不少。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"content":"好不容易等一切结束，你特意买了张民用砂船的返程票，顺便乔装了一下，为的就是不在路上和人复盘工作。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"content":"等到你穿戴帽子口罩落座时，你才长长舒了口气——是时候享受难得的闲暇了。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"speaker":"？？？","content":"劳驾……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"content":"邻座的乘客在砂船发出前最后一刻匆匆忙忙来到你身边，虽然赶急赶忙却依旧保持着礼貌客气，甚至称得上优雅——虽然你莫名觉得她有些拿腔拿调。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"content":"这是你第一次自费坐民用砂船，没有买头等舱或是商务舱的票，因此接下来的几个小时这位邻座乘客就将是与你相处“最亲密”的人了。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"content":"你挪开身体，趁着她过去的同时偷偷打量了下。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"speaker":"？？？","content":"感谢。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"content":"她从你身前挤过，身体挺得笔直地坐下，还不忘整理可能变得有些凌乱的衣襟，接着放下跟前的桌板，从包里取出一叠财经报纸、一个不知装着什么的纸包、一小瓶液体香薰、一套小巧精致的茶具以及……一个手摇咖啡机。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"content":"她将全部的这些东西整齐地码放在小小的桌板上，然后把纸包里的咖啡豆倒进手摇咖啡机里。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"speaker":"？？？","content":"你好，请问有热水吗……好的，谢谢。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"content":"你就这样目瞪口呆地看着她从服务人员手中接过热水，将磨好的咖啡粉过滤，等待的时候她还不忘翻了两页财经报纸——从咖啡豆的香气判断，它的品质绝对不低。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901035,"trial_step":35},{"step":35,"content":"等到咖啡泡好，她将瓷杯缓缓举起。即使是在如此狭窄的空间里做了这么多复杂的动作，她依旧看上去颇为优雅而不失风度，你甚至都有些佩服了。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"content":"就是她的脸，看着似乎有些眼熟。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"？？？","content":"你也要来一点吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"content":"似乎是注意到了你一直打量着她，邻座的乘客笑着端起咖啡壶。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"options":["谢谢","不用了"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901040,"trial_step":40,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"谢谢","goto":41},{"text":"不用了","goto":43}]},{"step":40,"content":"咖啡豆的香气确实引诱着你……喝一点应该不要紧吧？","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"content":"你从眼前的客用套装里拿出一次性纸杯。对方这么精致的人并没有嫌弃你的工具不对，而是笑着给你倒上了半杯。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901042,"trial_step":42,"next":[45]},{"step":42,"content":"你还没有疯到在半路上喝认识不到十分钟的人的咖啡，摇头拒绝。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"content":"对方倒也没有勉强，很客气地笑了笑。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"content":"无论如何，借着这件事你们稍稍拉近了距离。你看她是越看越眼熟，于是搭话道：","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"content":"你来自狄斯？还是……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"speaker":"？？？","content":"新城人。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"content":"她将咖啡喝完，迅速将杯子擦净收好。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"speaker":"？？？","content":"前些时候一直在砂海这一带公干，近期在新城有些事情才打算回去。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"content":"你是做什么工作的？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"speaker":"？？？","content":"就是些金融投资方面的事情。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"content":"金融？该不会你是新城的大人物吧？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不不不……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"content":"对方连忙摆手。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"speaker":"？？？","content":"虽然的确受到新城同行抬爱，被谬赞为“投资之神”，但这都不过是些虚名……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"speaker":"？？？","content":"实际上，我真正的兴趣在艺术、美食、时尚等领域，比起金融家，我认为自己更像是一名“职业享乐者”。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"content":"你下意识瞥了一眼装着档案的包，终于能确定眼前之人的身份了——怪不得看着眼熟，原来你苦心寻找的逃犯正是这位邻座乘客。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"content":"没想到你特意买民用船票想要避开麻烦，结果麻烦却主动找上了门。既然如此，你也没有逃避责任，打算在剩下几个小时里尽可能稳住她。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"这是何等的幸运啊……居然让我在一艘砂船上遇到一位知己。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"content":"芭·菲按着胸口长吁短叹着，一副相见恨晚的样子。不枉你在过去的几小时里搜肠刮肚应付她那些关于艺术品鉴等等方面的话题。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"content":"哪里，我只是恰巧认识一些从事艺术的朋友罢了。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"太谦虚了。您的知识储备与涵养可不是“认识几个朋友”就能达到的。尤其是部分关于音乐美术方面的独到见解，连我都自愧弗如啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"content":"你有些尴尬地笑了笑。管理局里的艺术家数量不少，你真的只是耳濡目染拾人牙慧而已，要是再来几个小时，你的储备恐怕就不足以应付了。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"content":"这样的话你自然不可能跟她解释。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"说起来，我这次回来就是为了今年的新春音乐会。像您这样有品位的绅士想必一定不会缺席的吧？","female_content":"说起来，我这次回来就是为了今年的新春音乐会。像您这样有品位的淑女想必一定不会缺席的吧？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_67","vo_trial_60901_1_67f"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"content":"……应该吧。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"content":"很遗憾，你压根没听说过什么新春音乐会，不出意外的话也没时间参加，只能含糊其辞应付过去。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"那真是再好不过了！","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"content":"砂船的速度慢了下来，你瞥了一眼窗外，黑暗中，船坞的工作人员正在挥舞着信号棒指挥砂船靠岸。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"看来分别的时候就要到了，唉，这是我有生以来第一次觉得坐砂船的过程太过短暂……诶，对了，要不要和我一起回去？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我跟合伙人联系过了，他应该会开我那辆加长幻灵来接。车的内饰是我花了大价钱找最好的改装师设计的，车上还有我珍藏的美酒，要不要……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"content":"你看着芭·菲坐在砂船经济舱上说着这样的话，莫名觉得有些好笑。但她真诚的表情却不似作伪，不像是吹嘘或者炫耀，而是一副单纯想与刚认识的朋友分享好东西的模样。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"content":"不过你还是拒绝了她——毕竟你才知道这位“投资之神”还有同伙，得赶紧通知管理局的行动部门多派点人手来。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"content":"谢谢，但我和朋友约好了。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"那样啊，还真是遗憾……不过不要紧，只要还在狄斯城，我们总有相遇的机会。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"她的同伙……真的会来吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"content":"你坐在管理局的车上，隔着玻璃观察芭·菲。她已经拖着行李在航站楼外的停车场里站了快一个小时。","style":3,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"content":"在这一小时里，她反复拨打着终端，但似乎一直没有拨通。夜风呼啸，等到停车场里的车几乎都走光了那位合伙人也没来，只留她一个人孤零零在风里瑟瑟发抖。","style":3,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"content":"算了，收网吧。","style":2,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901079,"trial_step":79},{"step":79,"content":"车缓缓开过去，你摇下车窗，对着鼻涕都快冻出来的芭·菲招了招手。","style":3,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"content":"捎你一程？","style":2,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"content":"凛冽的夜风已经基本吹散了她的思考能力，望着天降的救星，芭·菲满脸只有感动。","style":3,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901082,"trial_step":82},{"step":82,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"万分感谢……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"content":"进入管理局后，就算再迟钝，芭·菲也总算还是认出了你的身份。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1060900},{"step":84,"content":"如今的她坐在审查室的椅子上，没了停车场里涕泗横流的模样，而是恢复了初见时的优雅。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1060900},{"step":85,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"没想到与管理局局长阁下的初次见面，竟是如此尴尬失仪……不过想来这也是一段有趣的经历，或许能成为未来很多年餐桌酒席上的谈资呢。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1060900},{"step":86,"content":"这样说着，她脸上倒是没有半点尴尬，而是坐在椅子上微微欠身向你伸出手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1060900},{"step":87,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"正式认识一下吧。郁金香控股的执行董事兼投资顾问，芭·菲·美第奇。很高兴认识您，尊敬的局长阁下。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1060901},{"step":88,"content":"芭·菲微笑着，手举在半空中等待你的回应。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1060901},{"step":89,"options":["握手"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901091,"trial_step":91,"course":3,"drawing":1060901,"choices":[{"text":"握手","goto":92}]},{"step":90,"content":"“投资之神”的名号如雷贯耳。你的事迹我也早就有所耳闻。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1060901},{"step":91,"content":"你是旅居在外富商罗伯特·美第奇的遗孤，从108年回归狄斯城起就在上流社会活跃至今。在金融、艺术等领域收获了巨大的名望。他们将你称为新城贵族的典范。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1060901},{"step":92,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"哪里哪里，就像我之前说的，都是虚名而已……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1060902},{"step":93,"options":["但是——"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901095,"trial_step":95,"course":3,"drawing":1060902,"choices":[{"text":"但是——","goto":96}]},{"step":94,"content":"你的“但是”打断了芭·菲的谦虚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1060902},{"step":95,"content":"自从你半年前从新城公众视野消失之后，“投资之神”的名声可以说是急转直下。就连你任职的郁金香控股，目前也深陷破产传闻。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1060900},{"step":96,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"……所谓的上流社会就是这样，虽然我尽可能地想要和大家交朋友，但终究没办法讨好所有人。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1060900},{"step":97,"content":"芭·菲叹了口气，语气颇为惋惜。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1060900},{"step":98,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"的确，郁金香控股在半年前有一些负面新闻，恰巧那个时间节点我身处外邦，有一笔大生意必须我亲自去洽谈，错失了澄清的时机。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1060900},{"step":99,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"于是如您所见，我的敌人们当然不会放过这个机会，捕风捉影添油加醋落井下石，恐怕我的合伙人也是因此顶不住压力跑路了……当然，我不怪他们。换作是我也会这么做的。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1060900},{"step":100,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"不过嘛——","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1060900},{"step":101,"content":"芭·菲昂起头，神色中的阴霾一扫而空，取而代之的是一种成功人士特有的优雅自信。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1060903},{"step":102,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"既然芭·菲回到了她忠诚的狄斯城，谣言会不攻自破，所有的烂摊子也会被收拾得干干净净。“投资之神”是不会放任她的投资人朋友们蒙受损失的。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1060903},{"step":103,"content":"哦，是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1060903},{"step":104,"content":"芭·菲的回应自信又丰满，但涅槃给你的资料说的却完全是另一回事。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1060903},{"step":105,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":106,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":107,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":108,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":109,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":110,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":111,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":112,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":107,"course":6,"drawing":1060903},{"step":113,"content":"你拿出一沓资料，里面从照片到文字情报一应俱全。别在最上面的照片清晰地拍下了芭·菲从直升机上大把向下抛洒异方晶的一幕。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1060900},{"step":114,"content":"半年前你放出了“外邦异方晶矿”的消息。如今半年过去，所谓的异方晶矿开发工作毫无进展。看上去，你的所作所为只是在用欺诈的方式造成了异方晶市场的动荡，这对狄斯城的经济造成了严重的不良影响。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1060900},{"step":115,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"这您就有失偏颇了，我回到狄斯城，不正是要带回外邦异方晶矿的最新消息吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1060900},{"step":116,"content":"异方晶的事情只是起点。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1060900},{"step":117,"content":"你翻开资料，指着上面的照片继续讲道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1060900},{"step":118,"content":"那件事之后，新城各界——包括官方和受到损失的私人企业纷纷开始了对你的调查。其中有人认为，你的身份就有很大问题。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1060900},{"step":119,"content":"“芭·菲根本不是什么贵族遗孤，而是来自西区贫民窟的一个骗子。同时，芭·菲发迹初期的时间节点恰好对上了新城银行假币案。鉴于她的禁闭者身份已经核实，很可能凭借自身能力实施了犯罪。”","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1060900},{"step":120,"content":"有那么一瞬间，你似乎捕捉到了芭·菲眼中的失神，但当视线再次移回她脸上时，那奇妙的情绪却又消失不见了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1060904},{"step":121,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我想，这些资料……准确地说是这些对我不利的消息，应该是涅槃给您的吧？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1060900},{"step":122,"options":["无可奉告","是的"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901117,"trial_step":117,"course":3,"drawing":1060900,"choices":[{"text":"无可奉告","goto":118},{"text":"是的","goto":null}]},{"step":123,"content":"芭·菲笑了笑，似乎对你的回答并不在意。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1060900},{"step":124,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"所谓扰乱异方晶市场的说法，不过是涅槃的一面之词。事实上，若不是外邦有异方晶矿，我一个普通的投机者又能从哪里搞到这么多的异方晶呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1060903},{"step":125,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"您仔细想想，在外邦发现异方晶矿这件事，对全人类而言都是一件有百利而无一害的大好事。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1060903},{"step":126,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"唯一会对此感到恼怒、认为自己利益受损的，就只剩下涅槃了。毕竟对异方晶的垄断正是他们能够成长为巨头企业的唯一倚仗，所以——","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1060903},{"step":127,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"所以他们当然要无所不用其极地诋毁我，甚至拿我的禁闭者身份出来说事，试图摧毁我、乃至我本人名下资本的信誉。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1060903},{"step":128,"content":"在慷慨激昂地说了一大通之后，芭·菲停顿片刻，看向你的眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1060900},{"step":129,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"请您告诉我，局长阁下，如今的狄斯城，难道禁闭者的身份还是非法的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1060900},{"step":130,"options":["不是……"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901125,"trial_step":125,"course":3,"drawing":1060900,"choices":[{"text":"不是……","goto":126}]},{"step":131,"content":"没等你继续说出“不是”后面的话，芭·菲先抢着感慨道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1060900},{"step":132,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"就是嘛。您看看如今的狄斯城，商人、FAC、议会、艺术家，甚至包括他们涅槃自己，各行各业都有禁闭者的身影。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1060902},{"step":133,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"都已经115年了，这些人还在利用新城人的偏见，用这种过时又拙劣的方式攻击我，就因为我动了他们的蛋糕……真是滑天下之大稽。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1060902},{"step":134,"content":"重要的并不是禁闭者的身份。而是你是否有过将自己的能力，用于非法行为上。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1060900},{"step":135,"content":"关于这一点，涅槃给出的假币案情报和证据，倒是都指向你了呢。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1060900},{"step":136,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"真的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1060900},{"step":137,"content":"芭·菲偏过头，满脸写着无辜。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1060901},{"step":138,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"可在我看来，那些他们口中的“详尽证据”，只是满怀恶意的捕风捉影而已啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1060901},{"step":139,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"是的，我的确和可能是假币案分发渠道商的西区人吃过饭，但并不是所谓“私下接触”。相反，“芭·菲的晚餐”的请柬向来是公开发出的。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1060900},{"step":140,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我邀请的客人可以来自狄斯城的任何一个行业、任何一片街区，其中也不乏我的敌人，也就是如今这些造我谣的人——按照他们的逻辑，是不是这些人也与假币案脱不了干系呀？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1060900},{"step":141,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1060900},{"step":142,"content":"这方面芭·菲倒是没说错。关于最重要的假币案，涅槃给你的只是些间接证据，你没办法反驳。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1060900},{"step":143,"content":"见你没说话，芭·菲满意地理了理袖口，表情悠然自得。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1060900},{"step":144,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"所以啊，这里也不是法院或者金融巡查组的调查办公室，咱们现在讨论证据情报详尽不详尽，本身也没有太大的意义。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1060900},{"step":145,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"说到底，如果涅槃真的有足够详尽的证据，根本就不可能绕开金融巡查组，利用您来抓捕我，更别提花这么大力气精力和我打舆论战了。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1060903},{"step":146,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我倒是随时欢迎他们和我对簿公堂，说我身份造假、牵扯假币案，我还能反诉他们诽谤和垄断呢。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1060903},{"step":147,"content":"所以你回来就是为了和涅槃对簿公堂？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1060903},{"step":148,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"什么？不不不，我可没心情花功夫在这种事上。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_146"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1060902},{"step":149,"content":"芭·菲连连摆手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1060900},{"step":150,"content":"为什么不呢？打一场官司就能挽回自己的商业信誉危机，拯救郁金香控股，这样不好吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1060900},{"step":151,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"哈哈哈，您理解错了。这种个人名誉官司是一笔纯粹的烂账，就算费尽心思打赢了也没什么收益，反倒会消耗投资者的耐心。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1060902},{"step":152,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"投资者真正在意的是什么？是利润，是未来能赚多少钱，所以我这半年才一直待在外邦推进异方晶矿的工作。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1060900},{"step":153,"content":"但你毕竟回来了，难道就不能顺道澄清一下？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1060900},{"step":154,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"完全没有这个必要。适度的怀疑更有利于长期的信任。只要异方晶能运回来，所有现在跳脚的人都得求着分一杯羹，我何必和他们打口水仗。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1060900},{"step":155,"content":"不得不说，芭·菲这番话颇有力度，逻辑也自洽，无愧于金融大亨的身份。但越是这样，你的经验就越是告诉你：眼前这家伙隐瞒着大秘密。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1060900},{"step":156,"content":"按照刚刚的那套说辞，这个时间点她甚至没有理由回到狄斯城。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1060900},{"step":157,"content":"那你到底是为什么而回来？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1060900},{"step":158,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"为了新春音乐会啊！","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1060900},{"step":159,"content":"提到新春音乐会，芭·菲的表情变得非常兴奋，眼睛像是闪着光，与刚刚侃侃而谈的“投资之神”判若两人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1060900},{"step":160,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我在砂船上不是跟您说过了吗？那可是整个狄斯城乃至异邦音乐家的至高殿堂，一年一度的音乐盛会，甚至说它是狄斯城的文化符号也不为过。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_158"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1060900},{"step":161,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"更不用提年初的时候以亚欧大师公开宣布过，今年的新春音乐会将是他最后一场公开演出……半年前我就跟朋友们约好了一起去，这肯定是不能失约的呀。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_159"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1060900},{"step":162,"content":"看着芭·菲满是期待的脸，你莫名觉得有些好笑。你也算是见识过狄斯城形形色色的骗子、罪犯了，但是像她这样又老练狡猾、又天真的家伙，你倒是第一次碰见。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1060900},{"step":163,"content":"再怎么说也是上面点名要的重大经济嫌疑犯，你当然不可能放她去看什么音乐会。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1060900},{"step":164,"content":"……这个嘛，恐怕要让你失望了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1060900},{"step":165,"content":"芭·菲一怔，原本满脸的期待瞬间变为警觉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1060904},{"step":166,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我……不明白您的意思。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_164"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1060904},{"step":167,"content":"按照规定，MBCC有义务控制任何有犯罪嫌疑的禁闭者，以防其对狄斯城产生进一步的破坏。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1060904},{"step":168,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"您……您说笑了，我怎么可能破坏……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1060900},{"step":169,"content":"需要提醒你的是，MBCC与你熟知的治安局以及金融巡查组分属不同系统，我们不接受保释。同时，只要该禁闭者的嫌疑没有洗清，理论上我们就可以进行无限期的扣押。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1060900},{"step":170,"content":"你看到芭·菲额头上有一滴冷汗流了下来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1060900},{"step":171,"content":"我愿意相信你说的那些情况，所以不打算将你移交给涅槃。但是……唉，你是上头点名要的人，我也不好随随便便把你放出去。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1060900},{"step":172,"content":"这样吧，正好外面想找你麻烦的人很多，也算是我为你提供庇护了。你先留在管理局，等我把情报整理出来跟你核实了之后，再放你出去。就是这个时间嘛，可能会有点长。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1060900},{"step":173,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"多……多长？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_171"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1060900},{"step":174,"content":"顺利的话，十天半个月吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1060900},{"step":175,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"那这期间我能出去吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_173"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1060900},{"step":176,"content":"原则上肯定是不行的……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1060900},{"step":177,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"等等！","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_175"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1060904},{"step":178,"content":"一直以来保持优雅，全程没有破功的芭·菲，这一刻突然跟急了眼似地拼命摇头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1060904},{"step":179,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"等等等等……可是新春音乐会下周就要举办了呀！","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_177"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1060904},{"step":180,"content":"你依旧是一副公事公办犯难的样子。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1060904},{"step":181,"content":"看直播不行吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1060904},{"step":182,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"不不不，那完全就是两个概念。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_180"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1060904},{"step":183,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"大师谢幕，加上历年最豪华的阵容，这种级别的演出要是不能现场看，我绝对会抱憾终身，下半辈子回忆起来都得以泪洗面……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_181"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901178,"trial_step":178,"drawing":1060904},{"step":184,"content":"芭·菲一副悲痛欲绝的样子，没想到随便的一次试探居然让她起了这么大反应，你心里都有些犯了嘀咕。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901179,"trial_step":179,"drawing":1060904},{"step":185,"content":"这位“投资之神”真就对区区一场音乐会如此上心？你感觉不对劲，于是继续试探。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901180,"trial_step":180,"drawing":1060904},{"step":186,"content":"实在不行，我破例让你当晚过去，不过全程都得接受监视。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901181,"trial_step":181,"drawing":1060904},{"step":187,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"真的？","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_185"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901182,"trial_step":182,"drawing":1060900},{"step":188,"content":"芭·菲可怜巴巴地抬头望向你，眼里甚至隐约闪着泪花。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901183,"trial_step":183,"drawing":1060900},{"step":189,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"可是……只有那天晚上肯定来不及的呀。我得先去把门票弄到手。都这个时候了，预售早就结束，只能去找票务负责人了。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_187"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901184,"trial_step":184,"drawing":1060904},{"step":190,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"还有我邀请的朋友们。半年没回来了，再怎么说我也要亲自见一见他们……","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_188"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901185,"trial_step":185,"drawing":1060904},{"step":191,"content":"哈！你感觉自己抓住芭·菲的破绽了。你就知道她在这种微妙的时刻返回狄斯城，不可能就只是为了音乐会。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901186,"trial_step":186,"drawing":1060904},{"step":192,"content":"真正的目的，恐怕就隐藏在她这一周要见的那些人之中。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901187,"trial_step":187,"drawing":1060904},{"step":193,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"拜托您了，局长阁下，唯独这个我实在不想错过……看完演出之后，无论您有什么样的需要，只要是在我能力范围之内的，我一定尽全力帮您。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_191"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901188,"trial_step":188,"drawing":1060901},{"step":194,"content":"这样啊……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901189,"trial_step":189,"drawing":1060901},{"step":195,"content":"你装作为难的样子，心里却在暗自盘算着，一定要在这段时间里紧密监视芭·菲的行程，抓住她的马脚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901190,"trial_step":190,"drawing":1060901},{"step":196,"content":"同时，也不能轻易答应，以免她起疑猜到你的目的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901191,"trial_step":191,"drawing":1060901},{"step":197,"content":"我倒是的确有些情报想请你帮忙打听。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901192,"trial_step":192,"drawing":1060901},{"step":198,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"您请讲，我绝对知无不言、言无不尽！","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_196"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901193,"trial_step":193,"drawing":1060900},{"step":199,"content":"是这样，半年前，也正好就是你最活跃的那段时间，我在执行公务的过程中收到了一封匿名来信。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901194,"trial_step":194,"drawing":1060900},{"step":200,"content":"这个写信的人在某种意义上帮了我一把，但我很确定，此人还知道更多重要的情报。可我花了半年时间却始终追查不到信的来源。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901195,"trial_step":195,"drawing":1060900},{"step":201,"content":"我想，你这样交游广阔的成功商人，或许可以帮忙打探打探消息？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901196,"trial_step":196,"drawing":1060900},{"step":202,"content":"芭·菲面色短暂地一僵，旋即又满脸堆笑地答应道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901197,"trial_step":197,"drawing":1060904},{"step":203,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"包在我身上。等音乐会结束，我就发动所有人脉，帮您彻查！","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_201"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901198,"trial_step":198,"drawing":1060901},{"step":204,"content":"那多谢了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901199,"trial_step":199,"drawing":1060900},{"step":205,"content":"你把这几天的出行安排给我，到时候我会全程陪同……理解一下哈。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901200,"trial_step":200,"drawing":1060900},{"step":206,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"明白明白，您放心，我绝不会辜负这份信任的。","voice":["vo_trial_60901_1_204"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901201,"trial_step":201,"drawing":1060900},{"step":207,"content":"紧张了半天的芭·菲终于长舒了一口气。这下算是你们两个都能接受的结果了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160901202,"trial_step":202,"drawing":1060900}]}